---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Email & Privacy | Jevan Goldsmith" description="What happens when you sign up for Jevan Goldsmith's monthly updates." canonical="https://jevangoldsmith.com/privacy.html" noFooter>
  <main class="email-privacy">
    <h1>Email & privacy</h1>
    <p>When you sign up, you ask to receive my monthly letter with essays, project notes and reading recommendations.</p>
    <h2>What the form sends</h2>
    <p>Your email address, the form and page you used, any requested resource, and your subscription request are sent through FormSubmit to hello@jevangoldsmith.com. The list currently uses a manual signup process.</p>
    <p>The form also includes campaign labels from links you followed, the first page you visited in this browser session, and the referring website's hostname when available. This helps me understand how people find the newsletter. Your email address is not stored in browser storage or added to page URLs.</p>
    <h2>Changing your mind</h2>
    <p>To stop receiving updates, or ask about your signup details, reply to an email or contact <a href="mailto:hello@jevangoldsmith.com">hello@jevangoldsmith.com</a>.</p>
    <p><a href="https://formsubmit.co/privacy.pdf">FormSubmit's privacy information</a> explains how the form service handles submissions.</p>
    <p><a href="/newsletter.html">Back to the newsletter →</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
<style>
  .email-privacy { max-width: 740px; margin: auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem; color: var(--text-color); }
  h1 { font-family: Chivo, sans-serif; font-size: 2.6rem; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  p { line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-light); }
  a { color: var(--text-color); text-underline-offset: 4px; }
</style>
